10a:Tdb7,## Information pursuant to Section 5 DDG (German Digital Services Act)

**Operator:**

plastship GmbH\
Auf der Lind 10\
65529 Waldems

Registered office: Waldems\
Commercial Registry: HRB 30484\
Register court: Local court Wiesbaden

Represented by the managing directors\
Andreas Bastian\
Markus Dambeck

**Contact:**

Phone: [+49 6126 58 980 10](tel:+4961265898010)\
EMail: [info@plastship.com](mailto:info@plastship.com)

**VAT:**

VAT identification number pursuant to Section 27a of the German VAT Act (UStG):\
DE 319 452 749

**Consumer dispute resolution:**

We are neither willing nor obliged to participate in dispute resolution proceedings before a consumer arbitration board (Section 36 VSBG). Our services are aimed exclusively at businesses.

**Point of contact under the Digital Services Act:**

Single point of contact for authorities of the Member States, the European Commission and the European Board for Digital Services (Art. 11 of Regulation (EU) 2022/2065) and for recipients of our services (Art. 12 of Regulation (EU) 2022/2065):\
Email: [info@plastship.com](mailto:info@plastship.com)\
Phone: [+49 6126 58 980 10](tel:+4961265898010)

You can contact us in German or English. You can also use this point of contact to notify us of illegal content on the platform (see Section XII of our [Terms and Conditions](/agb)).

**Liability for content:**

As a service provider, we are responsible for our own content on these pages under the general laws. For third-party information that users post on the platform and that we store on their behalf, our liability is governed by Art. 6 of Regulation (EU) 2022/2065 (Digital Services Act); there is no general obligation to monitor this information or to actively seek facts or circumstances indicating illegal activity (Art. 8 of Regulation (EU) 2022/2065).

Obligations to remove or block the use of information under the general laws remain unaffected. However, liability in this respect is only possible from the time we become aware of a specific infringement. We will remove such content immediately upon becoming aware of any infringement.

**Liability for links:**

Our offer contains links to external websites of third parties, on whose contents we have no influence. Therefore we cannot assume any liability for these external contents. The respective provider or operator of the sites is always responsible for the contents of the linked sites. The linked pages were checked for possible legal violations at the time of linking. Illegal contents were not recognizable at the time of linking.

However, a permanent control of the contents of the linked pages is not reasonable without concrete evidence of a violation of the law. If we become aware of any infringements, we will remove such links immediately.

**Copyright:**

The contents and works on these pages created by the site operators are subject to German copyright law. The reproduction, editing, distribution and any kind of use outside the limits of copyright law require the written consent of the respective author or creator. Downloads and copies of these pages are only permitted for private, non-commercial use.

